    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SARAH: Because they’re family, Beth! And it’s only for a few days!\nBETH: Last year I found shit in my bed, mom. Human SHIT.\nSARAH: For the last time, that was their dog!\nOMI: I’m sure you will think of something.",
      "BETH: “They’re why some people shouldn’t be allowed to breed!” Your words, Mom, not mine!\nSARAH: I never said that! I said maybe they should have to take a test before they’re allowed to breed.",
      "SARAH: Marry Christmas, girls. Don’t you look cute in your matching jackets!\nLINDA: They’re a little cranky because the Steelers lost.\nLINDA: Jordan, Stevie, why don’t you tell Aunt Sarah about your Presidential Fitness Awards.",
      "LINDA: CHRISSY! Dammit Jordan, I told you to bring her inside!\nJORDAN: Not my kid.",
      "SARAH: A holiday roast is a surprise. Cancer is a surprise. She is a goddamn nightmare. What were you thinking?\nLINDA: Oh c’mon, she’s not that bad! And besides, she tricked me! I thought we were just dropping off gifts but she came to the door with a suitcas…\nSARAH: No, but you could at least warn me when one of your mistakes is going to become my problem.\nLINDA: You think everything I do is a mistakr."
    ]
